<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50729" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππο-βάμων</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾱ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, gen. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ονος</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>going on horseback, equestrian</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀριμασπὸν ἱπποβάμονα στρατόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					805
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατὸς ἱ.</span>, of centaurs,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				1095
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>trotting like a horse</i>, or <i>used for riding</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάμηλοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					284
				</span></i>
			 (cj. Turneb.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥήματα ἱ</span>.
			<i>high-paced</i> words, <i>bombast, fustian</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ra.</u>
				821
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
